  "explanation": "$u = \\tan^{-1}x$, $v = x$: $\\Big[x\\tan^{-1}x\\Big]_{0}^{1} - \\int_{0}^{1}\\frac{x}{1 + x^{2}}\\,dx = \\frac{\\pi}{4} - \\frac{1}{2}\\ln 2 \\approx 0.439$.",
